{"id": "EUVD-2026-108860", "enisaUuid": "d61c0cec-e150-34c3-a48c-170b96141d60", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nmailbox: imx: Use devm_pm_runtime_enable()\n\nsashiko complained about early usage of the device while probe isn't\ncompleted. This can be mitigated by delaying the pm_runtime_enable()\ninto the removal path instead doing it early. This ensures that in an\nerror case the device is removed (and imx_mu_shutdown()) before\npm_runtime_disable() so we don't have to do this manually.\n\nFor the order to work, lets move devm_mbox_controller_register() until\nafter the pm-runtime part. So the reverse order will be mbox-controller\nremoval followed by disabling pm runtime.\n\nUse devm_pm_runtime_enable(), remove manual pm_runtime_disable()\ninvocations and move the pm_runtime handling in probe before\ndevm_mbox_controller_register().", "datePublished": "2026-10-23T12:31:37", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-23T12:31:37", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b30a047744ea4344bb6f854b0a052cf276349128", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/adcaa21d50c3a4c884f4d0b7a95fa3bd7a07cf84", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1f602619e408b6e9655ee76656a2a5ab6e89c5e4", "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-98904"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-98904", "GHSA-6qfv-c5c2-gj3p"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.0, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "3a30b156-6eaa-3cfb-9d93-31f932a1123f", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "0 <6.18.53"}, {"id": "40e91db6-1427-3028-8c67-bc7be4919d61", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "0 <6.12.111"}, {"id": "7d1d97a8-5bdd-3de8-977e-78596ca7e6d8", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "1da177e4c3f41524e886b7f1b8a0c1fc7321cac2 <adcaa21d50c3a4c884f4d0b7a95fa3bd7a07cf84"}, {"id": "ab50fee3-1b6b-3096-8a38-142b7b96c27e", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2"}, {"id": "ced05182-8ca4-39fe-afc1-d526e7345967", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.53"}, {"id": "cf159901-8e52-3a8d-969c-9e4c15277a1e", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.12.111"}, {"id": "db027579-d741-3374-aca9-bd1eeebd7617", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "1da177e4c3f41524e886b7f1b8a0c1fc7321cac2 <b30a047744ea4344bb6f854b0a052cf276349128"}, {"id": "de7117c5-1fb7-30c9-a864-b8177070cd43", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "1da177e4c3f41524e886b7f1b8a0c1fc7321cac2 <1f602619e408b6e9655ee76656a2a5ab6e89c5e4"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "0471d043-03eb-37b7-842c-1ce81f69f649", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}